                                                "sense_id": "d876b474-acac-3929-8814-d3acbabd8bf9",
                                                "text": "Their frustration has surfaced in protests in several Libyan cities over the last few days, most notably in Benghazi, the seat of the revolution, where Libyans stormed the National Transitional Council building."
